  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of TBST specificity (%) in healthy children with negative IGRA results: DST 5mm vs QFT 99.06% (Starshinova 2018) and C-Tb vs QFT 91.43% (Aggerbeck 2018). The overall random-effects pooled specificity is 96.74% (85.52–99.33) across 176 participants.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنوعية اختبارات TBST (%) لدى الأطفال الأصحاء ذوي نتائج IGRA السلبية: DST 5 مم مقابل QFT 99.06% (Starshinova 2018)، وC-Tb مقابل QFT 91.43% (Aggerbeck 2018). وتبلغ النوعية المجمّعة الإجمالية بنموذج التأثيرات العشوائية 96.74% (85.52–99.33) لدى 176 مشاركاً.",
      "lang": "ar",
